WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.920
What’s your favorite part of Jazz Fest?

2
00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:06.940
Got to be the people, the friends, camaraderie during the fest, like putting it together.

3
00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:11.640
Because, like I said, I’ve been here a long time and a lot of people that are here have been here a long time.

4
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:15.640
So, it’s kind of a big dysfunctional family reunion.

5
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.780
Because everybody here, you take a cut in pay.

6
00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.780
I get half my normal pay to be here.

7
00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:23.720
So, nobody’s here for the money.

8
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:28.900
It’s all just a love of music and the event and the people.

9
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.540
So it’s a big family of friends.

10
00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:36.720
And then I have friends from all over come in for the event that I only see that one time of year.

11
00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.520
So, it’s a good reunion for them as well.

12
00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:41.460
It’s pretty good.

13
00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:45.760
So how would you define a successful year at Jazz Fest?

14
00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:48.500
What makes it a good year versus not a good year?

15
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:53.080
Successful year at Jazz Fest . . . they’ve all been pretty good.

16
00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:53.800
You know what I mean?

17
00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:59.640
Like, some . . . last year we had a ton of rain and lots of mud, and that doesn’t really bother me that much.

18
00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:02.680
It’s a little smelly, but I kind of embrace the rain and mud.

19
00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:11.380
I can’t do nothing about it. [laughs] And successful year at Jazz Fest is just seeing all the friends I want to see.

20
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:15.980
I have my special friends come to town and everybody having a good time.
